The left endpoint is open and the right endpoint is closed.

Domain: $-3<x\leq2$, or $(-3,2]$.

The lowest output is $-2$, included at the closed endpoint. The output $3$ is approached at the open endpoint and is not reached elsewhere.

Range: $-2\leq y<3$, or $[-2,3)$.
